    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "respite... i don't even know what that means anymore. everything is just so heavy. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise, to finally be still... is to just stop trying. is there any honor in just letting it end? like, if the story's already done, why keep making the characters suffer through the epilogue? it feels so pointless to keep dragging this out.",
